  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics": "图形与渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling": "剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore": "忽略的方块类型",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore.@tooltip": "设置哪些方块应渲染为 LOD。\n\n§6NONE：§r包含所有方块。\n§6NON_COLLIDING：§r仅渲染实体方块，忽略高草、火把等方块。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight": "洞穴剔除高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight.@tooltip": "从哪个 Y 坐标开始剔除洞穴？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling": "启用信标距离剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling.@tooltip": "开启后，不绘制靠近相机的信标，以避免与原版重复绘制。\n关闭后，渲染所有信标。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling": "禁用视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "关闭此选项：不绘制玩家相机视野之外的 LOD，提高 GPU 性能。\n\n开启此选项：绘制所有 LOD，包括相机背后的部分，降低 GPU 性能。\n\n如果视野边缘的 LOD 异常消失，可尝试关闭视锥剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling": "禁用阴影渲染阶段的视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "与另一项视锥剔除设置相同，但仅在使用 DH API 的光影模组进行阴影渲染时生效。\n\n如果阴影显示异常，可尝试关闭该阶段的视锥剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling": "启用洞穴剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling.@tooltip": "启用后剔除洞穴。\n\n当前实现会在没有维度顶棚的维度中，剔除洞穴剔除高度以下、天空光照值为 0 的所有表面。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv": "忽略的方块列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的方块资源位置列表，DH 不会渲染这些方块。空气始终包含在此列表中。\n\n如果出现缝隙或空洞，可能需要将 worldCompression 改为 MERGE_SAME_BLOCKS，并重新生成 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv": "洞穴中忽略的方块列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的方块资源位置列表。在天空光照为 0 的地下区域中，不渲染这些方块。空气始终包含在此列表中。\n\n默认列表为空，因为洞穴中的透明、非实体或液体方块通常已被自动忽略；可按需补充其他方块。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention": "过度绘制抑制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "设置遥远地平线从距相机多远的位置开始渲染，以原版渲染距离的比例表示。\n-1：自动，根据原版渲染距离调整。\n\n较大的值会在更远距离内阻止 LOD 在原版方块背后重复绘制，但可能造成 LOD 空洞，尤其是在飞越尚未加载的地形时。\n\n提高原版渲染距离可改善此设置的效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement": "快速移动时缩小过度绘制抑制范围",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement.@tooltip": "开启后，快速飞行或移动时，过度绘制抑制半径会收缩到更靠近相机的位置。\n\n这有助于缓解 Minecraft 加载或生成区块的速度跟不上 DH 时出现的问题。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks": "采用被忽略方块的颜色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks.@tooltip": "§4注意：这会使雪、地毯和活板门的显示效果变差。§r\n是否让被忽略方块下方的方块采用其颜色？\n§6开启：§r草地上的红花会将下方草地染红。\n§6关闭：§r被忽略的方块不会改变下方表面的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面下方块替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的方块资源位置列表。如果这些方块在水面处可见，则将其替换为水。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面方块替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的方块资源位置列表。位于水面上的这些方块将被移除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao": "启用屏幕空间环境光遮蔽 (SSAO)",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao.@tooltip": "为远景方块的凹陷处与夹角添加柔和阴影，极大增强远山与峡谷的立体层次感。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental": "实验",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio": "地球曲率倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio.@tooltip": "数值为 1 时相当于现实地球的曲率。\n允许的最小值为 50，最大值为 5000；1 到 49 之间的值会向上调整为 50。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv": "忽略的维度列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的维度资源位置列表，DH 不会在这些维度中渲染。示例：\"minecraft:the_nether,minecraft:the_end\"\n\n对于 Minecraft 1.12.2 及更早版本：打开 F3 界面，复制以黄色显示的 dimension_name:ID，例如 \"overworld:0\"。\n\n禁用 DH 渲染时，部分 DH 设置也会被禁用或调整，以改善显示效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine": "渲染引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine.@tooltip": "修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog": "迷雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog": "高级雾效选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode": "雾颜色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode.@tooltip": "LOD 上雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog": "启用遥远地平线雾效",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog.@tooltip": "控制是否在 DH 的 LOD 上绘制雾。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog": "启用原版雾效",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog.@tooltip": "§6开启：§rMinecraft 正常渲染雾。\n§6关闭：§r禁用原版区块上的雾。\n\n可能与其他修改雾效的模组冲突。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity": "雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity.@tooltip": "设置雾的密度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd": "雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd.@tooltip": "雾在何处达到终点？\n\n0.0：终点位于玩家所在位置。\n1.0：雾终点圆内接于 LOD 渲染范围的正方形。\n1.414：雾终点圆外接于 LOD 渲染范围的正方形。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff": "雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff.@tooltip": "如何计算雾的浓度？\n\nLINEAR：随距离线性变化，忽略密度参数。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(distance*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((distance*density)^2))\n\ndistance 为距离，density 为密度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax": "最大雾浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax.@tooltip": "雾的最大不透明程度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin": "最小雾浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin.@tooltip": "雾的最小不透明程度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart": "迷雾起始点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart.@tooltip": "雾从何处开始？\n\n0.0：从玩家所在位置开始。\n1.0：雾起始圆内接于 LOD 渲染范围的正方形。\n1.414：雾起始圆外接于 LOD 渲染范围的正方形。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog": "高度雾选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight": "高度雾基准高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight.@tooltip": "以指定高度为基准计算高度雾时，所使用的高度坐标。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity": "高度雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity.@tooltip": "设置高度雾的密度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection": "高度雾方向",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection.@tooltip": "高度雾应位于何处？\n\nABOVE_CAMERA：从相机向天空延伸。\nBELOW_CAMERA：从相机向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_CAMERA：从相机同时向天空和虚空延伸。\nABOVE_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向天空延伸。\nBELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度同时向天空和虚空延伸。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd": "高度雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd.@tooltip": "高度雾终点的偏移量。\n\n0.0：终点不偏移。\n1.0：偏移整个世界的高度范围，包括地下深度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff": "高度雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff.@tooltip": "如何计算高度雾的浓度？\n\nLINEAR：随高度线性变化，忽略密度参数。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(height*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((height*density)^2))\n\nheight 为高度，density 为密度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax": "最大高度雾浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax.@tooltip": "高度雾的最大不透明程度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin": "最小高度雾浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin.@tooltip": "高度雾的最小不透明程度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode": "高度雾混合模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode.@tooltip": "设置高度如何影响雾效。不确定时可先尝试 SPHERICAL、ADDITION 或 MAX。\n\nSPHERICAL：按相机距离计算雾。\nCYLINDRICAL：忽略高度，按水平距离计算雾。\nMAX：max(heightFog, farFog)\nADDITION：heightFog + farFog\nMULTIPLY：heightFog * farFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY：1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nLIMITED_ADDITION：farFog + max(farFog, heightFog)\nMULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + farFog * heightFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + 1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nAVERAGE：farFog*0.5 + heightFog*0.5\n\nheightFog 为高度雾，farFog 为远距离雾。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart": "高度雾起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart.@tooltip": "高度雾起点的偏移量。\n\n0.0：起点不偏移。\n1.0：偏移整个世界的高度范围，包括地下深度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering": "通用物体远景渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight": "信标光柱渲染高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight.@tooltip": "信标光柱在远景中向上绘制的最大 Y 轴高度限制。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv": "启用云层的维度列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的维度资源位置列表，DH 将在这些维度中渲染云层。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:overworld,minecraft:the_end\"\n\n修改后需要重新加载世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering": "渲染信标光柱",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering.@tooltip": "是否在超远视距下继续绘制信标直冲云霄的光柱。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering": "渲染远景云层",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering.@tooltip": "使用 DH 渲染拓展至视距边缘的远景云层。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering": "启用通用物体渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering.@tooltip": "允许 DH 在远距离渲染非地形物体（如信标光束和云层）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds": "启用多层云",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds.@tooltip": "关闭：与原版 Minecraft 一样，仅渲染一层云。\n开启：在不同高度渲染三层云。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons": "远距离信标光柱加粗",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons.@tooltip": "在极远距离下将信标光束渲染得更宽，避免因像素过细而在屏幕上闪烁消失。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture": "噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture": "启用噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture.@tooltip": "启用后，为 LOD 应用噪声纹理来模拟纹理细节。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff": "噪声衰减距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff.@tooltip": "设置噪声纹理淡出前的渲染距离，以方块为单位。\n设为 0 可禁止噪声淡出。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity": "噪声强度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity.@tooltip": "设置噪声纹理的强度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps": "噪声分级数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps.@tooltip": "设置应用到 LOD 上的噪声分级数量。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings": "覆盖原版图形设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings.@tooltip": "开启后，DH 初始化时会自动调整部分原版图形设置，以改善显示效果。\n\n例如禁用原版云（它们会绘制在 DH 的 LOD 上方）和区块淡入淡出（DH 已经负责原版区块的淡入淡出）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality": "画质细节",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier": "亮度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier.@tooltip": "远景方块的明暗亮度。0 = 全黑，1 = 正常，2 = 近乎纯白。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane": "远裁切面处淡出",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane.@tooltip": "在接近视距极限边缘时让远景平滑淡出，防止远处的云层和群山被直接横切截断。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade": "渐变消除近处 LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade.@tooltip": "开启后，靠近 LOD 时会逐渐将其淡出；关闭后，LOD 会在距相机的指定距离处直接消失。\n此选项受原版过度绘制抑制设置影响。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering": "草方块侧面渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering.@tooltip": "决定远景草方块侧面及底部绘制为全绿还是泥土底色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality": "LOD 细节衰减间距",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality.@tooltip": "控制相邻 LOD 细节降级之间的距离。\n\n较高的设置会扩大降级间距，同时增加内存和 GPU 占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale": "水平细节平滑缩放",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale.@tooltip": "远景 LOD 画质向远方递减衰减的快慢。\n数值越大远景越细腻，但显存和显卡消耗更高。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn": "放大视角时提升精细度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn.@tooltip": "在使用望远镜或变焦放大按键时，自动提升镜头所视方向的 LOD 细节品质。\n仅视野范围内的远景会提高精度至近距离级别的清晰度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending": "生物群系过渡平滑度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending.@tooltip": "为 LOD 区域应用类似原版的生物群系颜色过渡。\n\n注意：任何大于 0 的值都会增加 LOD 加载时间。\n\n0 对应原版的 1×1，1 对应 3×3，2 对应 5×5，以此类推。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius": "LOD 渲染半径（区块）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius.@tooltip": "遥远地平线的渲染距离，以区块为单位。\n\n这是尽可能达到的目标值；根据其他图形设置，实际渲染距离可能高于或低于此值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading": "LOD 明暗着色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading.@tooltip": "设置 LOD 的着色方式。\n可用于改善光影包兼容性。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution": "最大水平分辨率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution.@tooltip": "LOD 方块能呈现的最大细节精度。\n\n§6性能最佳：§r区块\n§6细节最多：§r单方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease": "最大放大画质提升档位",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease.@tooltip": "缩放视角时允许提升 LOD 画质的最大级数。数值越高，强力缩放时的地形越清晰，但缩放期间会增加内存和 GPU 占用。\n\n原版望远镜需要提升 4 级细节才能达到完整画质。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier": "色彩饱和度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier.@tooltip": "远景方块的色彩鲜艳度。0 = 黑白灰度，1 = 正常，2 = 鲜艳浓郁。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.transparency": "半透明方块渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff": "依摄像机位置计算精度递减",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff.@tooltip": "开启后根据视角摄像机位置决定 LOD 品质衰减；关闭则依据玩家实体坐标。\n开启有利于自由视角 (Freecam) 模组正确渲染；关闭有利于沉浸传送门等模组。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode": "原版区块与 LOD 过渡模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode.@tooltip": "原版 Minecraft 区块如何过渡到遥远地平线的 LOD？\n\nNONE：无过渡，最快，原版与远景之间有明显分界。\nSINGLE_PASS：单遍过渡，在原版透明物体渲染之后淡出，水下的不透明方块不会淡出。\nDOUBLE_PASS：双遍过渡，最慢，在原版不透明和透明物体渲染后分别淡出，过渡最平滑。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality": "垂直细节品质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality.@tooltip": "LOD 表现悬挑结构、洞穴、悬崖等地形的精细程度。\n\n较高的设置会增加内存和 GPU 占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture": "LOD 纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块标签",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的标签名称列表，DH 会对这些标签中的方块使用底面纹理绘制侧面。\n\n示例：\"grass_blocks,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv": "始终光栅化纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的方块资源位置列表，DH 将通过光栅化确定这些方块各面的纹理。\n\n可用于修复某些模组方块的侧面只使用模型纹理一部分时出现的问题。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:beacon\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv": "不渲染纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的方块资源位置列表，DH 不会为这些方块渲染纹理。\n支持部分匹配和不完整的资源位置。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "用逗号分隔的方块资源位置列表，DH 会用这些方块的底面纹理绘制侧面。\n支持部分匹配和不完整的资源位置。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods": "启用 LOD 纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods.@tooltip": "开启后，近处和放大观察的 LOD 将使用方块的实际纹理和轮廓渲染，不再仅显示单一颜色。\n\n仅对能够看清纹理的高精度 LOD 生效，远处 LOD 始终使用纯色。\n启用光影包时无效，因为光影包会使用自己的程序渲染 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel": "带纹理 LOD 的最大细节层级",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel.@tooltip": "允许使用方块纹理渲染的最大细节层级编号。层级编号越高，每个 LOD 覆盖的方块越多，纹理可能小于一个像素而无法看见。\n\n较大的数值会让更远的 LOD 使用纹理，但增加内存占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding": "LOD 构建与更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.logging": "日志",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading": "多线程",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer": "多人游戏",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode": "服务器数据文件夹命名方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode.@tooltip": "设置多人游戏数据在本地保存时的文件夹命名格式。\n\n§6仅名称：§r使用服务器列表中的名称，如 \"Minecraft Server\"。\n§6仅 IP：§r如 \"192.168.1.40\"。\n§6名称和 IP：§r如 \"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40\"。\n§6名称、IP 和端口：§r如 \"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565\"。\n§6名称、IP、端口和游戏版本：§r如 \"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565, GameVersion 1.18.1\"。\n\n§c§l注意：§r连接多人服务器时修改此设置可能导致异常。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.server": "服务器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator": "世界生成器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton": "显示配置按钮",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton.@tooltip": "在视场角按钮左侧显示配置按钮。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting": "画质预设",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting.@tooltip": "同时调整多项图形设置，快速改变遥远地平线的渲染画质。\n\n如果 GPU 已满负荷或帧率不佳，请降低此设置。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickEnableRendering": "启用渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickEnableRendering.@tooltip": "开启后，遥远地平线会在原版渲染距离之外渲染 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickShowWorldGenProgress": "显示 LOD 生成/导入进度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickShowWorldGenProgress.@tooltip": "开启后，世界生成或导入运行期间会在屏幕上显示进度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting": "CPU 负载",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting.@tooltip": "调整遥远地平线使用的线程数量。\n\n提高此设置会加快远景生成和 LOD 加载，但也会增加 CPU、内存占用，并可能引起卡顿。\n\n此设置按 CPU 的处理能力相对分配资源，因此在 2 核和 64 核 CPU 上应产生相近比例的负载。",
  "distanthorizons.config.common": "通用",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding": "LOD 构建",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.dataCompression": "数据压缩",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.dataCompression.@tooltip": "选择压缩新 LOD 数据所用的算法。\n此设置仅影响新增或更新的 LOD 数据。已有数据在需要重新写入数据库之前不会受影响。\n\n速度最快：LZ4\n压缩率最高：LZMA2",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.disableUnchangedChunkCheck": "禁用区块未变化检查",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.disableUnchangedChunkCheck.@tooltip": "禁用此检查可能修复方块变化后 LOD 未更新的问题。",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.experimental": "实验",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.experimental.upsampleLowerDetailLodsToFillHoles": "上采样低精度 LOD 以填补空洞",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.experimental.upsampleLowerDetailLodsToFillHoles.@tooltip": "开启后，DH 会尝试使用数据树中已有的数据填补缺失的 LOD，避免使用 N 尺寸生成器或服务器时，移动过程中出现空洞。\n\n§6实验性功能§r：会增加硬盘读写，并可能导致渲染问题。详情请查看配置文件。",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.worldCompression": "有损世界压缩",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.lodBuilding.worldCompression.@tooltip": "创建 LOD 数据时，应如何压缩方块数据？\n此设置仅影响新增或更新的 LOD 数据。已有数据在修改或重新加载之前不会受影响。\n\n最精确：合并相同方块\n压缩率最高：视觉等效",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.logging": "日志",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.logging.@tooltip": "控制日志的处理方式。",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.logging.globalChatMaxLevel": "全局聊天日志级别上限",
  "distanthorizons.config.common.logging.globalFileMaxLevel": "全局文件日志级别上限",
